      "dcterms:abstract": "We review how nuclear forces emerge from low-energy QCD via chiral eﬀective ﬁeld theory. The presentation is accessible to the non-specialist. At the same time, we also provide considerable detailed information (mostly in appendices) for the beneﬁt of researchers who wish to start working in this ﬁeld.",
